<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-RUSSIA BEAT CYPRUS IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RUSSIA BEAT CYPRUS IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia beat Cyprus 4-0 (halftime 2-0) in a World Cup soccer European group 5 qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Yuri Nikiforov (7th and 50th minutes), Igor Kolyvanov (34th), Vladimir Beschastnykh (82nd).</p>
